OL,3,GNEWSAOnions in your socks? Why homespun
OL,4,Acold remedies can work for some
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeborah Powis has a trick she swears by
OL,7,Fwhen she gets a cough.
OL,9,FI have stopped her on the street in the
OL,10,Fmarket town of Horncastle,
OL,11,FLincolnshire, to ask what cold remedies
OL,12,Fshe turns to at this time of year.
OL,14,F"You chop up an onion," she begins.
OL,15,F"You put it in plastic bags, put your
OL,16,Ffeet inside and put your socks over the
OL,17,Ftop.
OL,19,F"You do this overnight ` yes your
OL,20,Fsheets smell in the morning, but you
OL,21,Fcan wash your sheets."
